-- the 'case' arms to column 1 ends the continuation region, so 'match n'
-- is left with no case clauses. Expected: ONE parse-family error saying
-- the match expression is missing its 'case' clauses (anchored at the
-- match or at the dedented 'case'), since the layout mistake is the one
-- thing the user must fix. Currently THREE errors, none about layout:
-- two E_RECOVERY_DECLARATION_SKIPPED ("unexpected 'case' at start of
